                "loc": "JDG.19.1+JDG.19.2+JDG.19.3+JDG.19.4+JDG.19.5+JDG.19.6+JDG.19.7+JDG.19.8+JDG.19.9+JDG.19.10+JDG.19.11+JDG.19.12+JDG.19.13+JDG.19.14+JDG.19.15+JDG.19.16+JDG.19.17+JDG.19.18+JDG.19.19+JDG.19.20+JDG.19.21+JDG.19.22+JDG.19.23+JDG.19.24+JDG.19.25+JDG.19.26+JDG.19.27+JDG.19.28+JDG.19.29+JDG.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Pok 19:1-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Israel, idubo ugambre i ceng’ mi Gibeya: gicungo kuca; lwiny kum nyithindho mi dubo rubogi ngo i Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde m’ayenyo, abiponjogi; man kodhidhanu bicokri i wigi, kinde ma gibedo atwia kum gondri migi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Efraim en e rwaya ma juponjo, m’umaru yoko cam ku tiende; ento akadhu ku wi ng’ute ma ber: abiketho jaidh wi Efraim; Yuda bifuro, Yakobo bing’enyo thunglune.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
